1
00:00:02,335 --> 00:00:03,625
LEONARD: Nice move.
RAJESH: I've got it.

2
00:00:03,795 --> 00:00:05,755
HOWARD: Take him down.
LEONARD: He's got you, Sheldon.

3
00:00:05,922 --> 00:00:08,092
HOWARD: Come on.
LEONARD: He's completely schooling you.

4
00:00:08,258 --> 00:00:11,348
Hey, guys, some of the other waitresses
wanted me to ask you something.

5
00:00:11,511 --> 00:00:14,051
- It's Tressling.
- It combines the physical strength...

6
00:00:14,222 --> 00:00:18,602
(Howard:)...of arm wrestling with the mental agility
of Tetris into the ultimate sport.

7
00:00:18,768 --> 00:00:22,568
(Penny:)That's terrific, but what they wanted me
to ask you is to cut it the hell out.

8
00:00:22,731 --> 00:00:24,481
All right, come on, guys. Come on.

9
00:00:24,649 --> 00:00:28,569
WAIT STAFF [SINGING]:
Happy birthday to you

10
00:00:28,862 --> 00:00:30,782
(Sheldon:)We might as well stop, it's a stalemate.

11
00:00:30,947 --> 00:00:34,907
(Sheldon:)You're beating me in Tetris, but you've got
the upper body strength of a Keebler elf.

12
00:00:35,076 --> 00:00:37,366
(Raj:)Keebler elf?
I got a Keebler elf right here.

13
00:00:38,038 --> 00:00:40,038
[RAJESH GROAN ING]

14
00:00:42,417 --> 00:00:44,297
(Raj:)Okay, it's a stalemate.

15
00:00:45,795 --> 00:00:49,545
(Penny:)Leonard, will we be seeing you on Saturday
for your free birthday cheesecake?

16
00:00:49,716 --> 00:00:52,096
(Sheldon:)He can't eat cheesecake.
He's lactose intolerant.

17
00:00:52,260 --> 00:00:53,720
(Penny:)Okay, he can have carrot cake.

18
00:00:53,887 --> 00:00:56,767
- What about the cream-cheese frosting?
- He can scrape it off.

19
00:00:57,891 --> 00:01:01,021
(Leonard:)Forget about the cake.
How did you know my birthday's Saturday?

